0325-Wiznerowicz1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wiznerowicz</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Jakobsson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Szulc</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Liao</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Quazzola</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>The Kr&#x000fc;ppel-associated Box Repressor Domain Can Trigger de Novo Promoter Methylation during Mouse Early Embryogenesis.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>282(47)</volume><fpage>34535</fpage><lpage>34541</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17893143</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pgen.1000325-Shoichet1"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shoichet</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoffmann</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Menzel</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Trautmann</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Moser</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Mutations in the <italic>ZNF41</italic> gene are associated with cognitive deficits: identification of a new candidate for X-linked mental retardation.</article-title><source>Am J Hum Genet</source><volume>73</volume><fpage>1341</fpage><lpage>1354</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14628291</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pgen.1000325-Kleefstra1"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kleefstra</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Yntema</surname><given-names>HG</given-names></name><name><surname>Oudakker</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Banning</surname><given-n